      "source_id": "src-6e6b7e6b094d",
      "text": "What Deskloop does\nDeskloop answers customer support tickets for small businesses. It reads a company's existing help centre and past tickets, drafts a reply, and closes the ticket when the answer is already documented. It installs on Zendesk and Front.\nThe workflow\nDeskloop works inside the customer support tickets that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
