      "http_status": 200,
      "role": "pricing",
      "source_id": "src-9626c5827eea",
      "text": "Pricing\nDeskloop is billed per resolved ticket. The Starter plan is 49 dollars a month for 500 resolutions and the Team plan is 199 dollars a month for 3,000 resolutions.\nEvery plan includes a 14 day trial. No card is required to start.",
      "title": "Pricing - Deskloop",
